OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome clear spells this evening.
OL,7,FHowever, cloud will be increasing from
OL,8,Fthe northwest as bands of mostly light
OL,9,Frain quickly move southeastwards
OL,10,Facross all parts overnight. Rain
OL,11,Fclearing by dawn, with clearer spells
OL,12,Ffollowing. Windy. Generally mild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FA largely dry and bright
OL,15,Fstart. However, the clouds will build
OL,16,Fup to give some showers into the
OL,17,Fafternoon, mostly on western hills.
OL,18,FFeeling cool in the blustery winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
